<title>USA: IES Duane Arnold Iowa nuke seen back today.</title>
<headline>IES Duane Arnold Iowa nuke seen back today.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities' 538 megawatt Duane Arnold nuclear unit is expected to return to service Tuesday after shutting down Friday, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Tuesday in its plant status report.</p>
<p>The unit, in Palo, Iowa, has been in hot shutdown since last week's maintenance outage, the NRC report stated.</p>
<p>IES is a subsidiary of IES Industries Inc.</p>
<p>((--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
